  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 (2026-01-XX)\n- NEW: JWT signature verification support (HS256 and RS256)\n- NEW: VerifySignature() method for HMAC-SHA256 verification\n- NEW: VerifySignatureRS256() method for RSA-SHA256 verification\n- NEW: GetAlgorithm() method to detect JWT algorithm\n- NEW: Base64UrlEncode() method\n- NEW: JwtVerificationResult class for detailed results\n- IMPROVED: Complete signature verification documentation\n- 100% backward compatible with v1.0.x\n\nv1.0.1 (2026-01-XX)\n- Documentation improvements\n- Clean namespace (Johan.Common)\n- Verified no company references\n- NuGet package enhancements (README and LICENSE display)\n- All 58+ tests passing\n\nv1.0.0 (2026-01-XX)\n- Initial release\n- JWT expiration validation with clock skew support\n- Base64URL decoding\n- Thread-safe implementation\n- 58+ unit tests with ~100% API coverage",
